{"post_stream": {"posts": [{"id": 55444, "name": "Ben Cotton", "username": "bcotton", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/bcotton/{size}/28189_2.png", "created_at": "2021-11-12T21:07:34.829Z", "cooked": "<p><small>Originally published at:\t\t\t<a href=\"https://communityblog.fedoraproject.org/fridays-fedora-facts-2021-45/\" class=\"inline-onebox\">Friday's Fedora Facts: 2021-45 – Fedora Community Blog</a><br>\n</small><br></p><p>Here’s your weekly Fedora report. Read what happened this week and what’s coming up. Your contributions are welcome (see the end of the post)!</p><p></p>\n<p>Fedora Linux 33 will reach end of life on Tuesday 30 November. Nominations for the <a href=\"https://communityblog.fedoraproject.org/f35-elections-nominations-now-open/\">F35 elections cycle</a> are now open.</p>\n<p>The <a href=\"https://fedoraproject.limequery.com/231354\">F35 retrospective survey</a> is open through 4 December.</p>\n<p>I have weekly office hours on Wednesdays in the morning and afternoon (US/Eastern time) in #fedora-meeting-1. Drop by if you have any questions or comments about the schedule, Changes, elections, or anything else. See the <a href=\"#upcoming-meetings\">upcoming meetings</a> for more information.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#announcements\">Announcements</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#cfps\">Calls for Participation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#help-wanted\">Help wanted</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#upcoming-meetings\">Upcoming meetings</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#releases\">Releases</a></li>\n</ul><p></p>\n<h2>Announcements</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Nominations are open for the <a href=\"https://communityblog.fedoraproject.org/f35-elections-nominations-now-open/\">F35 elections</a>\n</li>\n<li>Registration is open for the <a href=\"https://hopin.com/events/fedora-linux-35-release-party/registration\">F35 Release Party</a>.</li>\n<li>Fedora Linux 33 reaches end of life on Tuesday 30 November.</li>\n<li>The Taiga instance on teams.fedoraproject.org will be <a href=\"https://communityblog.fedoraproject.org/retiring-taiga-instance-on-teams-fedoraproject-org/\">retired on 17 December</a>.</li>\n</ul><h3>CfPs</h3>\n<table>\n<thead><tr>\n<th>Conference</th>\n<th>Location</th>\n<th>Date</th>\n<th>CfP</th>\n</tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://fosdem.org/2022/\">FOSDEM devrooms</a></td>\n<td>online</td>\n<td>5–6 Feb</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://fosdem.org/2022/news/2021-11-02-devroom-cfp/\">closes 15 Nov</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.socallinuxexpo.org/scale/19x\">SCaLE</a></td>\n<td>Pasadena, CA, US</td>\n<td>5–8 Mar</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.socallinuxexpo.org/scale/19x/cfp\">closes 30 Nov</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><h2>Help wanted</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>359 <a href=\"https://fedoraproject.org/PackageReviewStatus/\">package review requests</a> are awaiting a reviewer</li>\n<li>\n<a href=\"https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/devel-announce@lists.fedoraproject.org/thread/5FCP5OSV6XXFCAXN5KPKQFBCDLGJSRB6/\">Orphaned packages</a> seeking maintainers</li>\n<li>The Fedora CoreOS team wants your feedback. Please take their short <a href=\"https://fedoraproject.limequery.com/865299\">communication survey</a>.</li>\n<li>What worked well—and what didn’t—during the F35 release cycle? Let me know in the <a href=\"https://fedoraproject.limequery.com/231354\">retrospective survey</a> by 4 December.</li>\n<li>The Design team wants your help <a href=\"https://communityblog.fedoraproject.org/fedora-linux-36-wallpaper-brainstorming/\">brainstorming F36 wallpaper designs</a>.</li>\n</ul><h3>Upcoming test days</h3>\n<p>The <a href=\"https://communityblog.fedoraproject.org/f36-test-days/\">call for F36 Test Days</a> is open.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>14–21 Nov — <a href=\"https://communityblog.fedoraproject.org/contribute-at-the-fedora-linux-36-test-week-for-kernel-5-15/\">Kernel 5.15 Test Week</a>\n</li>\n</ul><h2>Prioritized Bugs</h2>\n<p>See the <a href=\"https://docs.fedoraproject.org/en-US/program_management/prioritized_bugs/\">Prioritized Bugs documentation</a> for information on the process, including how to nominate bugs.</p>\n<h2>Upcoming meetings</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>FPgM Office Hours — <a href=\"https://calendar.fedoraproject.org/meeting/9527/\">1300 UTC Wednesday</a> and <a href=\"https://calendar.fedoraproject.org/meeting/9915/\">2000 UTC Wednesday</a> in #fedora-meeting-1</li>\n<li>Prioritized bugs meeting — <a href=\"https://calendar.fedoraproject.org/meeting/9964/\">1500 UTC Wednesday</a> in #fedora-meeting-1 </li>\n<li>Fedora Social Hour — <a href=\"https://calendar.fedoraproject.org/meeting/9743/\">1400 UTC Thursday</a> in <a href=\"https://matrix.to/#/#social:fedoraproject.org?web-instance%5Belement.io%5D=chat.fedoraproject.org\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">#social on Fedora.im</a> </li>\n</ul><h2>Releases</h2>\n<table>\n<thead><tr>\n<th>Release</th>\n<th>open bugs</th>\n</tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>F33</td>\n<td>4662</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>F34</td>\n<td>5536</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>F35</td>\n<td>1680</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>F36 (rawhide)</td>\n<td>6553</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><h3>Fedora Linux 35</h3>\n<h4>Elections</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>2021-11-17</strong> — <a href=\"https://communityblog.fedoraproject.org/f35-elections-nominations-now-open/\">Nomination period</a> ends</li>\n<li>\n<strong>2021-11-17</strong> — Interview period begins</li>\n<li>\n<strong>2021-11-24</strong> — Interview period ends</li>\n<li>\n<strong>2021-11-26</strong> — Voting begins</li>\n<li>\n<strong>2021-12-09</strong> — Voting ends</li>\n<li>\n<strong>2021-12-10</strong> — Results announced</li>\n</ul><h3>Fedora Linux 36</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>324 packages <a href=\"https://bugzilla.redhat.com/buglist.cgi?bug_status=__open__&amp;f1=blocked&amp;list_id=11983255&amp;o1=substring&amp;query_format=advanced&amp;v1=1992484\">fail to build from source</a>\n</li>\n<li>57 packages <a href=\"https://bugzilla.redhat.com/buglist.cgi?bug_status=__open__&amp;f1=blocked&amp;list_id=11983255&amp;o1=substring&amp;query_format=advanced&amp;v1=1992487\">fail to install</a>\n</li>\n</ul><h4>Changes</h4>\n<p>The table below lists proposed Changes. See the <a href=\"https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Releases/36/ChangeSet\">ChangeSet page</a> or <a href=\"https://bugzilla.redhat.com/buglist.cgi?f1=blocked&amp;list_id=11983255&amp;o1=substring&amp;query_format=advanced&amp;v1=F36Changes\">Bugzilla</a> for information on approved Changes.</p>\n<table>\n<thead><tr>\n<th>Proposal</th>\n<th>Type</th>\n<th>Status</th>\n</tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Changes/Openldap_25\">OpenLDAP 2.5</a></td>\n<td>System-Wide</td>\n<td>Approved</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Changes/drop_NIS_support_from_PAM\">Drop NIS(+) support from PAM</a></td>\n<td>System-Wide</td>\n<td>Approved</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Changes/retire_NIS_user_space_utils\">Retire the NIS(+) user-space utility programs</a></td>\n<td>System-Wide</td>\n<td>Approved</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Changes/Package_information_on_ELF_objects\">Package information on ELF objects</a></td>\n<td>System-Wide</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://pagure.io/fesco/issue/2687\">FESCo #2687</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Changes/ReplaceFbdevDrivers\">Replace the fbdev drivers with simpledrm and the DRM fbdev emulation layer</a></td>\n<td>System-Wide</td>\n<td>Approved</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Changes/rubygem-cucumber_7.1.0\">Rubygem Cucumber 7.1.0</a></td>\n<td>Self-Contained</td>\n<td>Approved</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Changes/Stratis_3.0.0\">Stratis 3.0.0</a></td>\n<td>Self-Contained</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://pagure.io/fesco/issue/2691\">FESCo #2691</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Changes/RemoveLaFiles\">Remove .la files from buildroot</a></td>\n<td>Self-Contained</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://pagure.io/fesco/issue/2693\">FESCo #2693</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Changes/Java17\">java-17-openjdk as system JDK in F36</a></td>\n<td>System-Wide</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://pagure.io/fesco/issue/2694\">FESCo #2694</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Changes/ELN-Extras\">ELN-Extras</a></td>\n<td>System-Wide</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/devel@lists.fedoraproject.org/thread/K6N2ZO64JBPZVTFYW74SSKY744GGCRRS/\">Announced</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><h2><span>Contributing</span></h2>\n<p>Have something you want included? You can file an issue or submit a pull request in the <a href=\"https://pagure.io/fedora-pgm/pgm_communication\">fedora-pgm/pgm_communication repo</a>.</p>", "post_number": 1, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 1, "updated_at": "2021-11-12T21:07:34.829Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 11, "reads": 10, "readers_count": 9, "score": 87.0, "yours": false, "topic_id": 34477, "topic_slug": "fridays-fedora-facts-2021-45", "display_username": "Ben Cotton", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "link_counts": [{"url": "https://communityblog.fedoraproject.org/fedora-linux-36-wallpaper-brainstorming/", "internal": false, "reflection": false, "title": "Fedora Linux 36 wallpaper brainstorming!", "clicks": 1}, {"url": "https://fedoraproject.limequery.com/865299", "internal": false, "reflection": false, "title": "Fedora CoreOS Community Survey", "clicks": 1}, {"url": "https://fedoraproject.limequery.com/231354", "internal": false, "reflection": false, "title": "F35 Retrospective", "clicks": 1}, {"url": 